    <h1 class="page-title">I used to write cheats. Now I get paid to stop them.</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">I'm Justin Mazzola, a software and reverse engineer born and raised in New York. I've been taking software apart for 15+ years now - the first chunk of that writing cheats, and everything since trying to stop them.</p>
  </div>
